WEBVTT

00:17:57.545 --> 00:18:01.283
and encouraging aquatic organisms
to eat more carbon dioxide.

00:18:01.307 --> 00:18:04.288
At the moment, these things
are fringe research;

00:18:04.312 --> 00:18:08.064
they're not central to the human effort
to face this problem

00:18:08.088 --> 00:18:09.629
or problems in general.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:12.852
And with problems
that we are not aware of yet,

00:18:12.876 --> 00:18:18.954
the ability to put right -- not the sheer
good luck of avoiding indefinitely --

00:18:18.978 --> 00:18:21.771
is our only hope, not just
of solving problems,

00:18:21.795 --> 00:18:23.229
but of survival.

00:18:23.711 --> 00:18:27.659
So, take two stone tablets

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:30.179
and carve on them.